<MainLayout title="About AI Pulse" description="Our mission and editorial approach."><div class="wrap"><header class="page-title"><span class="eyebrow">About us</span><h1>Clarity in a fast-moving field.</h1><p>AI Pulse is an independent English-language publication following the research, products, business, policy, and people shaping artificial intelligence.</p></header><article class="article-body"><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We aim to explain what happened, why it matters, and what remains uncertain. Our coverage is grounded in primary sources and attributed reporting. We distinguish confirmed facts from analysis and update stories when meaningful new information emerges.</p><h2>Editorial standards</h2><p>Automation can assist research and drafting, but publication requires source verification, clear attribution, and editorial review. We do not publish fabricated quotes, unsupported claims, or unverified announcements.</p></article></div></MainLayout>
